 "name_en": "Assess Dangerous Goods for a Product (3FC)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Assess Dangerous Goods for a Product (3FC)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loiob2306a79ecba47859039ec4dfd69c6f6\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiob2306a79ecba47859039ec4dfd69c6f6__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">This scope item supports the classification of products according to dangerous goods regulations.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">When a product is intended to be transported, the product steward specialist assigns compliance purposes to the product. These compliance purposes specify the dangerous goods regulations that are relevant for the transport of the product. You, as a dangerous goods specialist, are responsible to assess the product. If the product is a dangerous good, you classify it according to the applicable dangerous goods regulations and determine whether the transport of this product is allowed in a certain country/region by the certain mode of transport. During the classification process, the system generates the dangerous goods description with rules that are specified in each dangerous goods regulation. This describe can be printed on documents, such as sales order confirmations and delivery notes.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiob2306a79ecba47859039ec4dfd69c6f6__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Flag products as relevant for a compliance assessment</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Determine countries or regions where a product is planned to be transported</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Derive relevant compliance purposes based on countries or regions where transport is required</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Assess dangerous goods classification for an unpackaged product</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Assess dangerous goods classification for all related packaged products</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiob2306a79ecba47859039ec4dfd69c6f6__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Integrate the dangerous goods assessment of a product with the process of creating and changing products</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Integrate the dangerous goods assessment of a product with your logistic processes</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Use compliance requirements out-of-the-box for dangerous goods regulations in different countries or regions for certain modes of transport</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Manage the impact of changing and evolving dangerous goods regulatory requirements on how and where your products can be transported</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>针对产品评估危险品 (3FC)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loiob2306a79ecba47859039ec4dfd69c6f6\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiob2306a79ecba47859039ec4dfd69c6f6__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">此范围项目支持根据危险品法规对产品进行分类。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">计划运输产品时，产品管理专家会为产品分配合规性目的。这些合规性目的指定与产品运输相关的危险品法规。作为危险品专家，您负责评估产品。如果产品是危险品，则根据适用的危险品法规对其进行分类，并确定是否可以通过特定运输方式在特定国家/地区运输此产品。在分类流程中，系统会使用每个危险品法规中指定的规则生成危险品描述。此描述可以打印在销售订单确认和交货单等凭证上。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiob2306a79ecba47859039ec4dfd69c6f6__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">将产品标记为与合规性评估相关</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">确定计划运输产品的国家或地区。</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">根据需要运输的国家或地区，派生相关的合规性目的</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">评估无包装产品的危险品分类</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">评估所有相关有包装产品的危险品分类</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiob2306a79ecba47859039ec4dfd69c6f6__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">将产品危险品评估与创建和更改产品的流程集成。</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">将产品危险品评估与物流流程集成。</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">针对特定运输方式，将开箱即用的合规性要求用于不同国家或地区的危险品法规</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">管理不断变化的和不断变化的危险品法规要求，以及产品运输方式和运输地点的影响</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
